  "faqWhyEditNotLoad": "Why didn''t the data load to the edit page automatically?",
  "faqWhyEditNotLoadAns": "Due to the data structure, if your data was saved in a different language previously, it will not be loaded automatically. However, you can still edit it starting from a blank state.",
  "faqWhyNotificationNotWork": "Why isn''t the notification working?",
  "faqWhyNotificationNotWorkAns": "1. Go to your device Settings > Apps > FoodList > Notifications and make sure notifications are enabled.\n2. Disable battery optimization for FoodList (Settings > Battery > Battery Optimization > FoodList > Don''t optimize).\n3. Toggle the notification switch off and on again in the app to re-register the alarm.",
  "faqWhyNotificationDelay": "Why is the notification delayed?",
  "faqWhyNotificationDelayAns": "FoodList uses a system alarm that may be delayed by a few minutes by Android to save battery. This is normal and expected. If the delay is more than 30 minutes, try disabling battery optimization for the app.",
